+	// VaultSync (#316): a device that goes on sharing a folder removed here
+	// does not announce it again by itself. It sends its cluster config when
+	// a connection is set up or when its own configuration changes, and a
+	// removal on this side is neither, so the folder never became pending
+	// until the next reconnect. Close the connections to the devices the
+	// folder was shared with, as is done above for a device whose ignored
+	// folder was un-ignored: the connection service dials again at once, and
+	// both sides announce their folders on the new connection.
+	//
+	// It has to come after cleanPending, which discards what is pending for
